            <title>[IGNITE-4836] Yarn deployment is ignoring memory limits</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-4836</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Yarn deployment is ignoring  IGNITE_MEMORY_OVERHEAD_PER_NODE, so server nodes can be killed by yarn due to &quot;running beyond physical memory limits&quot;.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
